{"channelId":"UC2BDs0pu-C1A4POY0g9rZxw","row":["Relax My Dog - Relaxing Music for Dogs",2040000,"RelaxMyDog specialises in music and TV designed to help any dog breed with a variety of problems including separation anxiety, sleep problems, loneliness, boredom and depression. Our music and TV is produced and created in-house by a team of experts aiming to help as many dogs as possible reduce anxiety and sleep issues. Wondering how to calm my dog? Give our music and TV and try!\n\nWe have helped over 20 million dogs worldwide with anxiety problems, sleep problems, depression and loneliness and are excited to help millions more using:\n\n• Relaxing Music Therapy\n• Entertaining and Stimulating TV\n• Advice, DIY and How-To Vlogs","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2BDs0pu-C1A4POY0g9rZxw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2BDs0pu-C1A4POY0g9rZxw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:07.471Z","channelId":"UC2BDs0pu-C1A4POY0g9rZxw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e5f1c18426c40bf9b9111a96e54b90f63d8a890a72f12cbf21796d27034ccc92","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"1ba372da6fc043d426c9ff7345d7f4fcd3cd17d4b624252a5c61adf3b37f9b77"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2BDs0pu-C1A4POY0g9rZxw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:16:24.891Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2BDs0pu-C1A4POY0g9rZxw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2040000,"raw":"2.04M subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2BDs0pu-C1A4POY0g9rZxw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:07.471Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_re